:: Witch Hut
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if V.fsData.jiusiDisappointed === 1>>
<span class="grey">木架上落了一层灰，窗纸破了一角也没人去补。柜台后面的女巫看着比上回更睁不开眼。</span>
<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $fsData.witch is undefined>><<set $fsData.witch to { met: false, asked: [] }>><</if>>
<<if $fsData.witch.met isnot true>>
	<<set $fsData.witch.met to true>>
	门帘是用旧布拼的，颜色褪得看不出原样。你掀开它走进去——
	<br><br>
	屋里比外面窄得多，架子上堆着说不清用途的瓶罐，柜台后面趴着一个<span class="fs-celeste">身材矮小、米白色头发的女孩</span>，脸埋在胳膊里，呼吸均匀。
	<br><br>
	听见动静，她抬起半边眼皮看了你一眼。
	<br><br>
	"欢迎光临——"她的声音拖得很长，像是从梦里拽出来的，"我是<span class="fs-celeste">西蕾丝提娅</span>。这里是<span class="gold">魔女小屋</span>。"
	<br><br>
	说完，她又把脸埋了回去。
<</if>>
<<if $fsData.witch.met is true>>
	帘子里的空气有股旧纸和草药混在一起的味道。西蕾丝提娅趴在柜台上，看起来并不打算醒。
<</if>>

<br><br>
<span class="fs-sub">（她似乎不介意你自己看。）</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[瞧瞧有什么|Witch Hut Shop]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[请求装备刻印|Witch Hut Seal]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[询问|Witch Hut Ask]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[离开|Elk Street]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Shop
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if $fs_witchTab is undefined>><<set $fs_witchTab to "seal">><</if>>
"自己看吧，"西蕾丝提娅没有抬头，"别碰左边的罐子，那里面装的是会记仇的东西。"
<br><br>
<<link [[魔法刻印|Witch Hut Shop]]>><<set $fs_witchTab to "seal">><</link>>
<<if $fs_witchTab is "seal">> <span class="gold">←</span><</if>>
|
<<link [[魔法祝福卷轴|Witch Hut Shop]]>><<set $fs_witchTab to "scroll">><</link>>
<<if $fs_witchTab is "scroll">> <span class="gold">←</span><</if>>
|
<<link [[魔法小道具|Witch Hut Shop]]>><<set $fs_witchTab to "items">><</link>>
<<if $fs_witchTab is "items">> <span class="gold">←</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<span class="gold">持有：£<<print Math.floor($money / 100)>></span>
<br><br>
<<if $fs_witchTab is "seal">>
	<<if $magicBook isnot 1>>
		"刻印啊……"她终于抬起眼，"你要那个做什么？你连魔书都没有。"
		<br>
		<span class="fs-sub">（没有魔书的话，买了也没用。）</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<for _sk range finalStar.sealList>>
		<<set _s to finalStar.seals[_sk]>>
		<div class="fs-shop-item">
			<span class="fs-shop-name"><<icon _s.icon>> <<print _s.name>>刻印 <<if finalStar.hasSeal(_sk)>><span class="green">（已拥有）</span><<elseif $fsData.sealEquipped is _sk>><span class="teal">（装配中）</span><</if>></span>
			<span class="fs-shop-desc"><<print _s.desc>></span>
			<<if finalStar.hasSeal(_sk) or $fsData.sealEquipped is _sk>>
				<span class="fs-shop-price"><span class="green">已在你的收藏中</span></span>
			<<elseif $money gte (_s.price * 100)>>
				<<capture _sk>>
					<<set _label to "购买" + finalStar.seals[_sk].name + "刻印（£" + finalStar.seals[_sk].price + "）">>
					<<link _label "Witch Hut Shop">>
						<<set $money -= finalStar.seals[_sk].price * 100>>
						<<run finalStar.giveSeal(_sk)>>
						<<set $fs_witchTab to "seal">>
					<</link>>
				<</capture>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="fs-shop-price"><span class="red">£<<print _s.price>> —— 钱不够</span></span>
			<</if>>
		</div>
	<</for>>
<<elseif $fs_witchTab is "scroll">>
	卷轴在匣子里躺着，纸边泛着淡金。
	<br>
	<span class="fs-sub">临时卷轴生效 30 天；永久卷轴的价格是两倍。</span>
	<br><br>
	<<for _ck range finalStar.scrollList>>
		<<set _c to finalStar.scrolls[_ck]>>
		<div class="fs-shop-item">
			<span class="fs-shop-name"><<icon _c.icon>> <<print _c.name>></span>
			<span class="fs-shop-desc"><<print _c.desc>></span>
			<span class="fs-shop-price">
				临时（30 天）：<span class="gold">£<<print _c.price>></span>
				<<if $money gte (_c.price * 100)>>
					<<capture _ck>>
						<<link [[ 买下 |Witch Hut Shop]]>>
							<<run finalStar.buyScroll(_ck, false)>>
							<<set $fs_witchTab to "scroll">>
						<</link>>
					<</capture>>
				<<else>> <span class="red">（钱不够）</span> <</if>>
				<br>
				永久：<span class="gold">£<<print _c.price * 2>></span>
				<<if $money gte (_c.price * 200)>>
					<<capture _ck>>
						<<link [[ 买下 |Witch Hut Shop]]>>
							<<run finalStar.buyScroll(_ck, true)>>
							<<set $fs_witchTab to "scroll">>
						<</link>>
					<</capture>>
				<<else>> <span class="red">（钱不够）</span> <</if>>
			</span>
		</div>
	<</for>>
	<<if $fsData.scrolls and $fsData.scrolls.length gt 0>>
		<br>
		<span class="gold">你身上带着的卷轴：</span>
		<br>
		<<for _i to 0; _i lt $fsData.scrolls.length; _i++>>
			<<set _item to $fsData.scrolls[_i]>>
			<<set _def to finalStar.scrolls[_item.key]>>
			<<capture _i>>
				<<set _label to "展开" + _def.name + "（" + (_item.permanent ? "永久" : (_item.days + " 天后失效")) + "）">>
				<<link _label "Witch Hut Shop">>
					<<run finalStar.useScroll(_i)>>
				<</link>>
			<</capture>>
			<br>
		<</for>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $pistolOwned isnot 1 and finalStar.gunUnlocked() isnot true>>
		"枪？"她掀起眼皮，"你走的是哪条线，自己心里清楚。"
		<br>
		<span class="fs-sub">（你不属于玖肆线，或者还没和她走到那一步——现在买这个没用。）</span>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif finalStar.gunUnlocked() isnot true>>
		<<link [[告诉她自己把枪弄丢了|Witch Hut Gun]]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if finalStar.gunUnlocked()>>
		<div class="fs-shop-item">
			<span class="fs-shop-name"><<icon "finalstar/pistol-standard.png">> 制式手枪</span>
			<span class="fs-shop-desc">通体发黑的手枪，不同的是枪身雕刻着一只蛇形图案。</span>
			<<if $pistolOwned is 1>>
				<span class="fs-shop-price"><span class="green">你已经有了一把</span></span>
			<<elseif $money gte 90000>>
				<<link [[购买（£900）|Witch Hut Shop]]>>
					<<set $money -= 90000>>
					<<set $pistolOwned to 1>>
					<<set $pistolAmmo to ($pistolAmmo ? $pistolAmmo : 0) + 6>>
					<<run finalStar.giveBullets("normal", 6)>>
				<</link>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="fs-shop-price"><span class="red">£900 —— 钱不够</span></span>
			<</if>>
		</div>
		<br>
		<<for _bk range finalStar.bulletList>>
			<<set _b to finalStar.bullets[_bk]>>
			<div class="fs-shop-item">
				<span class="fs-shop-name"><<icon _b.icon>> <<print _b.name>> <span class="fs-sub">（现有 <<print finalStar.bulletCount(_bk)>> 发）</span></span>
				<span class="fs-shop-desc"><<print _b.desc>></span>
				<span class="fs-shop-price">
					单发 <span class="gold">£<<print _b.price>></span>
					<<if $money gte (_b.price * 100)>>
						<<capture _bk>>
							<<link [[ 买 1 发 |Witch Hut Shop]]>>
								<<set $money -= _b.price * 100>>
								<<run finalStar.giveBullets(_bk, 1)>>
								<<set $fs_witchTab to "items">>
							<</link>>
						<</capture>>
					<<else>> <span class="red">（钱不够）</span> <</if>>
					<<if $money gte (_b.price * 1000)>>
						<<capture _bk>>
							<<link [[ 买 10 发 |Witch Hut Shop]]>>
								<<set $money -= _b.price * 1000>>
								<<run finalStar.giveBullets(_bk, 10)>>
								<<set $fs_witchTab to "items">>
							<</link>>
						<</capture>>
					<</if>>
				</span>
			</div>
		<</for>>
	<</if>>
		<br>
		<span class="gold">◆ 小药瓶</span>
		<br>
		<span class="fs-sub">消耗品，买下后可以直接在这里喝掉。</span>
		<br>
		<<if $fs_vialMsg>>
			<br><span class="green"><<print $fs_vialMsg>></span><br>
			<<set $fs_vialMsg to "">>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<for _vk range finalStar.vialList>>
			<<set _v to finalStar.vials[_vk]>>
			<div class="fs-shop-item">
				<span class="fs-shop-name"><<icon _v.icon>> <<print _v.name>> <span class="fs-sub">（身上 <<print finalStar.vialCount(_vk)>> 瓶）</span></span>
				<span class="fs-shop-desc"><<print _v.desc>></span>
				<span class="fs-shop-price">
					<span class="gold">£<<print _v.price>></span>
					<<if $money gte (_v.price * 100)>>
						<<capture _vk>>
							<<link [[ 买一瓶 |Witch Hut Shop]]>>
								/* ⚠️ 这里不能写 _v.price：_v 是段落级临时变量、循环结束时等于最后一个药瓶，
								   点击时才求值 → 买 £70 的药会按 £100 扣（探针抓到的真 bug）。
								   _vk 被 capture 了，所以用它现取。 */
								<<set $money -= finalStar.vials[_vk].price * 100>>
								<<run finalStar.buyVial(_vk)>>
								<<set $fs_witchTab to "items">>
							<</link>>
						<</capture>>
					<<else>> <span class="red">（钱不够）</span> <</if>>
					<<if finalStar.vialCount(_vk) gt 0>>
						<<capture _vk>>
							<<link [[ 喝掉一瓶 |Witch Hut Shop]]>>
								<<set _res to finalStar.useVial(_vk)>>
								<<set $fs_vialMsg to _res.msg + (_res.notes and _res.notes.length ? "（" + _res.notes.join("；") + "）" : "")>>
								<<set $fs_witchTab to "items">>
							<</link>>
						<</capture>>
					<</if>>
				</span>
			</div>
		<</for>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[回到柜台|Witch Hut]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Gun
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
"弄丢了？"西蕾丝提娅这次是真的醒了。她坐直身体，眯着眼把你从头看到脚。
<br><br>
"枪是响尾蛇的东西。丢了就得再买一把——不过，规矩是规矩。"她伸手在柜台下摸索了一阵，把一枚刻着蛇形的小木牌推给你。
<br><br>
"拿着。以后你要买枪和子弹，我不拦你。"
<br><br>
<span class="green">西蕾丝提娅为你开放了枪械购买权限。</span>
<<run finalStar.unlockGun()>>
<br><br>
<<link [[继续|Witch Hut Shop]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Seal
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if $magicBook isnot 1>>
	"我说了，"西蕾丝提娅闭着眼，"没有魔书，刻印贴在你脸上也没用。"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[回到柜台|Witch Hut]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	她终于睁开眼，直起身子。
	<br><br>
	"把书拿出来。"
	<br><br>
	你把魔书放在柜台上。她伸手在上面按了一下——纸页无声地翻动，露出一片空白。
	<br><br>
	"要贴哪一枚？"
	<br><br>
	<<if $fsData.sealEquipped and $fsData.sealEquipped isnot "none">>
		<span class="fs-sub">当前装配：<span class="teal"><<print finalStar.sealName($fsData.sealEquipped)>></span>（替换下来的刻印不会返还）</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<set _owned to 0>>
	<<for _sk range finalStar.sealList>>
		<<set _s to finalStar.seals[_sk]>>
		<<if finalStar.hasSeal(_sk)>>
			<<set _owned++>>
			<<capture _sk>>
				<<set _label to "装配" + finalStar.seals[_sk].name + "刻印">>
				<<link _label "Witch Hut Seal Done">>
					<<run finalStar.equipSeal(_sk)>>
				<</link>>
			<</capture>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="fs-sub"><<icon _s.icon>> <<print _s.name>>刻印 —— <span class="grey">未拥有</span></span>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</for>>
	<<if _owned is 0>>
		<br>
		<span class="fs-sub">（你身上一枚刻印也没有。）</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[算了|Witch Hut]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Witch Hut Seal Done
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
西蕾丝提娅把那张印着图案的羊皮纸按在书页上。纸面浮起一层金色的流沙，一层层渗进纸里，直到什么也看不见。
<br><br>
她收回手，撑着脑袋看你："好了。"
<br><br>
<span class="green">刻印已装配到魔书上。</span>
<br><br>
"还有什么事吗？"
<br><br>
<<link [[没有|Witch Hut]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Ask
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if $fsData.witch.asked is undefined>><<set $fsData.witch.asked to []>><</if>>
<<if $fsData.witch.asked.length is 0>>
	"问吧。"她没有睁眼。
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if !$fsData.witch.asked.includes("origin")>>
	<<link [[为什么你们会出现在这里|Witch Hut Ask Origin]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$fsData.witch.asked.includes("world")>>
	<<link [[这个世界究竟怎么了|Witch Hut Ask World]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $fsData.witch.asked.includes("origin") or $fsData.witch.asked.includes("world")>>
	<<link [[聊日常|Witch Hut Ask Daily]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[没事了|Witch Hut]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Ask Origin
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<run $fsData.witch.asked.pushUnique("origin")>>
西蕾丝提娅睁开眼。这次她的表情认真得有些陌生。
<br><br>
"这里出现了非常恐怖的异常。"她说，"不是怪物，也不是诅咒——是<span class="red">现实本身在被改写</span>。有些东西正在把这座镇子的因果拆开重写，今天发生的事，明天就会变成'从来没有发生过'。"
<br><br>
"我们是被派来稳定它的。组织里叫这个任务<span class="gold">『终星』</span>——因为如果最后一点光也熄了，就没有人能记得这里曾经有过什么。"
<br><br>
她顿了顿，声音低下去。
<br><br>
"这件事，别对任何人说。不是不信任你——是知道的人越多，异常扩散得越快。"
<br><br>
<span class="green">你似乎明白了什么，又似乎什么也没明白。</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[继续|Witch Hut Ask]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Ask World
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<run $fsData.witch.asked.pushUnique("world")>>
她没有回答，只是伸出手，在你头上揉了两下。她的手很凉。
<br><br>
"这个世界怎么了？"她把问题重复了一遍，像是在念一句别人的台词，"还能怎么了——坏掉了，烂掉了，被人啃过一遍又一遍。"
<br><br>
"但只要我们还在一天。"她收回手，重新趴回柜台，"一切都会好起来的。"
<br><br>
她说这话时的语气很轻，轻得像是怕吵醒自己。
<br><br>
<<link [[继续|Witch Hut Ask]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Ask Daily
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
你试着不去想那些糟心的事——至少现在你还活着，还能看见太阳，还能看见熟悉的人。
<br><br>
你决定和西蕾丝提娅聊聊日常：今天的天气、麋鹿街的猫、镇上新开的赌场。
<br><br>
她没有理你。呼吸很均匀。
<br><br>
<span class="fs-sub">（……睡得真快。）</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[回到柜台|Witch Hut]]>><</link>>
